# Simfinity Naming Conventions

## Entity Setup Files

| Concern | File Pattern | Extension |
|---|---|---|
| Create form | `<entity>.create.ts` | `.ts` (`.tsx` if JSX) |
| Edit form | `<entity>.edit.ts` | `.ts` (`.tsx` if JSX) |
| View form | `<entity>.view.tsx` | `.tsx` |
| Column renderer | `<entity>.column.<field>.tsx` | `.tsx` |
| State machine | `<entity>.stateMachine.ts` | `.ts` |
| Entity wiring | `index.ts` | `.ts` |

## Registration Functions

| Type | Pattern | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Form customization | `register<Entity><Mode>Customization` | `registerSerieCreateCustomization` |
| Column renderer | `register<Entity><Field>Column` | `registerEpisodeDateColumn` |
| State machine | `register<Entity>StateMachine` | `registerSeasonStateMachine` |
| Entity setup | `setup<Entity>Customization` | `setupEpisodeCustomization` |

## i18n Label Keys

| Pattern | Example |
|---|---|
| `entity.<type>.single` | `entity.serie.single` |
| `entity.<type>.plural` | `entity.serie.plural` |
| `<type>.<field>` | `serie.name` |
| `<type>.step.<stepId>` | `serie.step.basicInfo` |
| `stateMachine.<type>.state.<STATE>` | `stateMachine.season.state.ACTIVE` |
| `stateMachine.<type>.action.<action>` | `stateMachine.season.action.activate` |
